WEBVTT

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.365
We turn north, and keep climbing.

00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:09.657
A hundred kilometres up, particles from the Sun strike the last traces of air.

00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:12.916
Oxygen glows green, and higher still, red.

00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:16.109
Nitrogen adds a fringe of blue and violet.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.407
From the ground, it is a curtain.

00:01:18.607 --> 00:01:22.207
From here, it is a river of light, flowing around the pole.

